.DS_Store
bin/wt
bin/wt-session
bin/wt-model
# Root-anchored: only ignores a stray `wt` binary at the repo root (from
# `go build ./cmd/wt-session`), not the `cmd/wt-session` source directory.
/wt
# The same stray binary from `go build` run inside cmd/wt-session.
/cmd/wt-session/wt-session
/cmd/wt-session/wt

# Root-anchored: a stray `wt-model` binary at the repo root (from
# `go build ./cmd/wt-model` run inside wt/) was once swept into a commit; the
# `cmd/wt-model` source directory stays tracked.
/wt-model
# The same stray binary from `go build` run inside cmd/wt-model.
/cmd/wt-model/wt-model

# NOTE: a global ~/.gitignore (outside this repo's control) ignores `.claude/`.
# This repo intentionally tracks `.claude/skills/` — a local negation pattern
# here can't override the global ignore, so new files under `.claude/` need
# `git add -f`.
